initions.html#Extension.extension:idExpirationDate\" title=\"Slice idExpirationDate: The expiration date of the PWD ID card. Record an expiration date only when supplied by the issuing source; do not infer one from age or disability category. Validity rules depend on the applicable dated policy.\">extension:idExpirationDate</a><a name=\"Extension.extension:idExpirationDate\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/extensibility.html#Extension\" class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">Extension</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">PWD ID Expiration Date</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1350.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline_slicer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin_slice.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_extension_simple.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: #F7F7F7; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Simple Extension\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">Extension.Slices for extension.extension:idExpirationDate.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-ph-core-pwd-disability-definitions.html#Extension.extension:idExpirationDate.extension\" class=\"xhtPieceStrikeout\">extension</a><a name=\"Extension.extension:idExpirationDate.extension\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBo